    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional attack\n- Great chance of evading enemy's attack\n*When attacking*\n- DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every attack performed*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 200%)\n*If HP is 85% or more when attacking, or if the target enemy\nis in the following status: {passiveImg:atk_down} or {passiveImg:def_down}*\n- Launches an additional attack that has a high chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n- High chance of performing a critical hit\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g} for every attack performed\n(up to 300%)\n*After evading 3 or more attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Launches an additional attack that has a high chance\nof becoming a Super Attack\n*As the 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Launches an additional attack that has a high chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n- \"Majin Buu Saga\" Category allies' Ki +1 and ATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g},\nplus an additional Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g} for characters\nwho are also Extreme Class, for 3 turns\n*When 4 or more \"Majin Buu Saga\" Category allies are on the team,\nor when all allies are Extreme Class characters*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 15%{passiveImg:up_g} when attacking\n- {passiveImg:once}Evades enemy's attack within the turn when the\ncharacter is the 1st attacker at the start of turn",
